# An intro change must not publish every lit part at zero.
# Seed 42's intro mutes the acid. The pad and the hat are the song.
# Leave the acid and Pluck, both on that muted part, and the open hat off
# so it cannot tick through the hole. Break, then back into that intro.
# The two keys are still on. The acid has to keep playing.
seed 42
reboot
wait 80
expect iamsec 0
expect iammask 65
expect iamlay 0
expect iamdon 16
key w0 down
wait 40
key w0 up
key b3 down
wait 40
key b3 up
key b4 down
wait 40
key b4 up
key w2 down
wait 40
key w2 up
key w12 down
wait 40
key w12 up
wait 1600
expect iamsec 0
expect iammask 4
expect iamlay 256
expect iamdon 0
expect par0 0
expect par1 48
tap SAVE
wait 1600
expect iamsec 3
tap OCT-
wait 1600
expect iamsec 0
expect iammask 4
expect iamlay 256
expect par0 0
expect par1 48
